霓虹时钟首先是霓虹时钟，你可以打开侧边栏（左下角点小按钮）就能看到效果了以下要放到styles.styl里
/* 霓虹时钟 */.words&#123;    font-size: 25px;    font-weight: bold;    text-transform: uppercase;    fill: none;    stroke-width: 1px;    stroke-dasharray: 35,125;    animation-name: drawing;    animation-duration: 6s;    animation-iteration-count: infinite;    animation-timing-function: linear;&#125;.words-1&#123;    stroke: deepskyblue;    animation-delay: -1.5s;&#125;.words-2&#123;    stroke: lightseagreen    animation-delay: -3s;&#125;.words-3&#123;    stroke: orange;    animation-delay: -4.5s;&#125;.words-4&#123;    stroke: purple;    animation-delay: -6s;&#125;@keyframes drawing &#123;    100%&#123;        stroke-dashoffset: -160    &#125;&#125;
以下放到你想让霓虹时钟出现的位置就好啦～
&lt;!--霓虹时钟--&gt;&lt;div&gt;    &lt;svg&gt;        &lt;text id=&quot;time&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; x=&quot;36%&quot; y=&quot;80%&quot; class=&quot;words words-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/text&gt;        &lt;text id=&quot;time&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; x=&quot;36%&quot; y=&quot;80%&quot; class=&quot;words words-2&quot;&gt;&lt;/text&gt;        &lt;text id=&quot;time&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; x=&quot;36%&quot; y=&quot;80%&quot; class=&quot;words words-3&quot;&gt;&lt;/text&gt;        &lt;text id=&quot;time&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; x=&quot;36%&quot; y=&quot;80%&quot; class=&quot;words words-4&quot;&gt;&lt;/text&gt;    &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;script&gt;function showtime()&#123;    var noatime = new Date();    var h = noatime.getHours(),        m = noatime.getMinutes(),        s = noatime.getSeconds();    h=checktime(h);    m=checktime(m);    s=checktime(s);  return h+&quot;:&quot;+m+&quot;:&quot;+s;&#125;function checktime(x)&#123;  if(x&lt;10)&#123;    x=&quot;0&quot;+x;  &#125;  return x;&#125;var div1=document.getElementsByTagName(&quot;text&quot;);setInterval(function()&#123;  for (var i in div1)&#123;      div1[i].innerHTML=showtime();  &#125;&#125;,1000);&lt;/script&gt;

